We have several assemble actions: assemble_transport_leg (requires origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready, both not occupied). assemble_origin_loaded_leg (requires origin_node_occupied, destination_node_ready, not origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed). assemble_destination_loaded_leg (requires origin_node_ready, destination_node_occupied, origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed). assemble_fully_loaded_leg (requires origin_node_occupied, destination_node_occupied, not origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed).

